   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `checkpoints/` | [sd3.5_large_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-diffusion-3.5/resolve/main/sd3.5_large_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | 14.93 GB |\n\nOne file: the text encoders and the VAE are inside the checkpoint.\n\n**VRAM:** ComfyUI uses what it is given: 15.4 to 17.4 GiB (whole GPU) on a free 24 GB card. A second ComfyUI limited to a 12 GiB budget (`--reserve-vram`) peaked at 12.2 GiB (13.1 GiB whole GPU); limited to 10 GiB it peaked at 10.2 GiB (11.1 GiB whole GPU), took 24-25 s and gave byte-identical pictures. Not verified on a 12 GB card.\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3** (the Size node needs a recent ComfyUI; older versions were not tested). **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: Stability AI Community License. Free for research, non-commercial use, and commercial use under $1M annual revenue. Read the model page.\n"
   ]
  }
